{"repo": {"timestamp": 1794587966000, "version": 20002, "name": "Bullarr", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://gwenvador.github.io/bullarr-android/repo", "description": "D\u00e9p\u00f4t Bullarr Android (application pour piloter Bullarr). Obtainium peut aussi suivre les releases GitHub : https://github.com/gwenvador/bullarr-android"}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"categories": ["Reading"], "suggestedVersionName": "1.9", "suggestedVersionCode": "13", "description": "Application Android pour piloter Bullarr : biblioth\u00e8que de bandes dessin\u00e9es,\nsuivi des s\u00e9ries et des nouveaut\u00e9s, recherche et t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement, mode hors ligne.\n", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/gwenvador/bullarr-android/issues", "license": "Unknown", "name": "Bullarr", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/gwenvador/bullarr-android", "summary": "Pilote Bullarr, le gestionnaire de biblioth\u00e8que BD, depuis le t\u00e9l\u00e9phone", "webSite": "https://github.com/gwenvador/bullarr", "added": 1793611629000, "packageName": "io.github.gwenvador.bullarr", "lastUpdated": 1794587966000, "localized": {"en-US": {"icon": "icon_ZrSX8oI9Pbdp3qjgbF5FYPTyW2uoyA_mZp1ikSUz1Xg=.png", "whatsNew": "\u2022 Upscaling of low-resolution pages in the reader (built-in Fast model, others downloadable).\n\u2022 Actions \u2192 Upscaling and server settings (admins); Upscale/Reduce/Restore on albums and series.\n\u2022 News: long press for actions, Import all, one series for the whole group.\n\u2022 Search: + button to add a series. Mihon extension.\n\u2022 Imports: omnibus, special or episode.\n\u2022 Requires Bullarr 13.0.\n"}, "fr-FR": {"whatsNew": "\u2022 Upscaling des pages basse d\u00e9finition dans le lecteur (mod\u00e8le Rapide int\u00e9gr\u00e9, autres \u00e0 t\u00e9l\u00e9charger).\n\u2022 Actions \u2192 Upscaling et r\u00e9glages serveur (admins) ; Upscaler/R\u00e9duire/Restaurer sur album et s\u00e9rie.\n\u2022 Nouveaut\u00e9s : appui long pour les actions, Tout importer, s\u00e9rie choisie pour tout le groupe.\n\u2022 Recherche : bouton + pour ajouter une s\u00e9rie. Extension Mihon.\n\u2022 Imports : int\u00e9grale, HS ou \u00e9pisode.\n\u2022 N\u00e9cessite Bullarr 13.0.\n"}}}], "packages": {"io.github.gwenvador.bullarr": [{"added": 1794587966000, "apkName": "bullarr-android-1.9.apk", "hash": "becdc94fa4268767f21d537e9ef7000a74f7e655daf49dae090e6570caecf8ad", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 26, "nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a"], "packageName": "io.github.gwenvador.bullarr", "sig": "8d7e52798dd1cea7cf88e34c1d14bac6", "signer": "cef915fef814abb006e1f6ae31efbc778a3cd12cc548226662e73c987e15da30", "size": 20950626, "targetSdkVersion": 36, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC", null], ["android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS", null], ["android.permission.WAKE_LOCK", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE", null], ["io.github.gwenvador.bullarr.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION", null]], "versionCode": 13, "versionName": "1.9"}, {"added": 1794297313000, "apkName": "bullarr-android-1.8.apk", "hash": "e2d5a96a45437c6ca6bc9b32c1ecebbe1a423d834b9f7cd4f14902f159d05332", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 26, "nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "packageName": "io.github.gwenvador.bullarr", "sig": "8d7e52798dd1cea7cf88e34c1d14bac6", "signer": "cef915fef814abb006e1f6ae31efbc778a3cd12cc548226662e73c987e15da30", "size": 15037995, "targetSdkVersion": 36, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC", null], ["android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS", null], ["android.permission.WAKE_LOCK", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE", null], ["io.github.gwenvador.bullarr.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION", null]], "versionCode": 12, "versionNa